[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2551009324","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100550#issuecomment-2551009324","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100550","id":2551009324,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YDVAs","user":{"login":"Scrawach","id":40476180,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNDc2MTgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40476180?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach","html_url":"https://github.com/Scrawach","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-18T10:56:11Z","updated_at":"2024-12-18T10:56:11Z","body":"I added an extra commit by removing `clear` and replacing it with `pop_back`. This is because in the process I came across a bug in the solution, when another lambda is called inside one lambda and the bracket in the expression is not closed and not extra line before EOF:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc test(function1: Callable) -> void:\r\n\tfunction1.call()\r\n\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n\ttest(func(): test(func(): print(\"hello\"))\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf lambdas are called within each other, the unclosed parenthesis at the end of the expression, in addition to the expected `Expected closing ')' after calling arguments` error, will also report an empty lambda stack error from `pop_expression_indented_block`:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/6395450b10d73bc3515763c7bbd1b2f5b7425d10/modules/gdscript/gdscript_tokenizer.cpp#L295-L299\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2551009324/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2551012298","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100550#issuecomment-2551012298","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100550","id":2551012298,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YDVvK","user":{"login":"Chaosus","id":3036176,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzYxNzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3036176?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus","html_url":"https://github.com/Chaosus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-18T10:57:18Z","updated_at":"2024-12-18T10:57:18Z","body":"Commits needs to be squashed (see https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/workflow/pr_workflow.html#modifying-a-pull-request)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2551012298/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2551041798","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100550#issuecomment-2551041798","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100550","id":2551041798,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YDc8G","user":{"login":"Scrawach","id":40476180,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNDc2MTgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40476180?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach","html_url":"https://github.com/Scrawach","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-18T11:12:07Z","updated_at":"2024-12-18T11:12:07Z","body":"@Chaosus fixed.\r\n\r\nBut, PR don't pass static checks with file formatting. It require newline at end of file, but this issue (#96228) about miss newline at end of file. And that's we need for regression. What to do?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2551041798/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2551055468","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100550#issuecomment-2551055468","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100550","id":2551055468,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YDgRs","user":{"login":"Chaosus","id":3036176,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzYxNzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3036176?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus","html_url":"https://github.com/Chaosus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-18T11:19:22Z","updated_at":"2024-12-18T11:19:22Z","body":"> But, PR don't pass static checks with file formatting. It require newline at end of file, but this issue (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/96228) about miss newline at end of file. And that's we need for regression. What to do?\r\n\r\nIf it's a test for error, you need to create it at `tests/scripts/runtime/errors` (look on other tests in that category as a reference).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2551055468/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2551099230","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100550#issuecomment-2551099230","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100550","id":2551099230,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YDq9e","user":{"login":"Scrawach","id":40476180,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNDc2MTgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40476180?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach","html_url":"https://github.com/Scrawach","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-18T11:40:19Z","updated_at":"2024-12-18T11:40:56Z","body":"> If it's a test for error, you need to create it at tests/scripts/runtime/errors (look on other tests in that category as a reference).\r\n\r\nNo, this is not a error test. There shouldn't be any errors right now. But the style checker wants a newline at end of the GDScript file. And if I add that line, the test is meaningless. Because it worked before with an newline too. \r\n\r\nIssue #96228 about GDScript file without an newline (or something else) after lambda expression. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2551099230/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_githu